安，不了解也不掌握公司的商业秘密，自己不是履行竞业限制义务的适格主体。某保安公司向仲裁委员会申请仲裁。 月薪3500元保安跳槽，公司以违反竞业协议索赔20万元被驳回"},"attached_info":"CkoImbzIzPrHxcc/EAMaCTExNDUzNDA4NCCG4/6/BjAAOKMBQA5yEzE4OTU5NTI4MDk2NDEzNDIzMjJ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"84 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-ee2d4fde58616738e856390bc2eda511_720w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"15_1744947416.767833","card_id":"Q_1895839562317660504","card_label":{"type":"new","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-a4b0b52b561281109c51e4957cb20130_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-10ef6526c602e55a8c606e46aa0cc586_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1895839562317660400,"title":"勇士队的库里、巴特勒、格林今年就想冲击总冠军，会不会太着急了？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1895839562317660504","type":"question","created":1744783374,"answer_count":30,"follower_count":30,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[35496,1355302],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkkImbzIzPrHxcc/EAMaCTExNDUyNjYyNiCOkP2/BjAAOB5AD3ITMTg5NTgzOTU2MjMxNzY2MDUwNHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"74 万热度","trend":0,"debut":true,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-469b06e9f9061b5c3612a90d8afba47b_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"16_1744947416.768409","card_id":"Q_1896308213307131131","card_label":{"type":"new","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-a4b0b52b561281109c51e4957cb20130_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-10ef6526c602e55a8c606e46aa0cc586_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1896308213307131100,"title":"鲍威尔放「鹰」，表示不救市，不降息，特朗普称「他被解雇的速度再快都不为过」，哪些信息值得关注？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1896308213307131131","type":"question","created":1744895109,"answer_count":22,"follower_count":35,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"peo